WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Standing heavy punch starts the near-corner conversion.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.700
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.350
Standing heavy punch connects after raw Drive Rush.

4
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.100
Back heavy punch juggles after the first Drive Rush Cancel.

5
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.900
The second Drive Rush Cancel empties Luke’s remaining gauge as standing heavy continues.

6
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.600
Perfect heavy Flash Knuckle connects while Luke is in Burnout.

7
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.050
Luke cancels Perfect heavy into Pale Rider.

8
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.900
Pale Rider finishes at the wall with Luke still in Burnout.
